# Pytest Verification Rules

- **Runner**: Always execute tests via `uv run pytest <path/to/test_file.py> -q`.
- **No Live External Network**: Mock all external HTTP calls with `respx` or `httpx.MockTransport`. Never hit live third-party APIs in unit or integration tests.
- **Database Isolation**: Use the transactional `db_session` fixture from `tests/conftest.py` so every test rolls back cleanly.
- **Assertions**: Use plain `assert` statements and `pytest.raises(ExpectedError, match="...")`.
